ithub.io/projects/learn-claude-code/s07/04-context/</guid><description>跟踪描述、正文、参考文件的可见时间，解释加载后的保留、重复调用和压缩。</description></item><item><title>S13.4 Worktree Isolation：用独立工作目录隔离改动</title><link>https://dextermayhewjd.github.io/projects/learn-claude-code/s13/04-worktree-isolation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://dextermayhewjd.github.io/projects/learn-claude-code/s13/04-worktree-isolation/</guid><description>&lt;div class="chapter-outline" id="s13-worktree-outline" aria-labelledby="s13-worktree-outline-title"&gt;
&lt;p class="chapter-outline__title" id="s13-worktree-outline-title"&gt;本节目录&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;nav id="TableOfContents"&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#worktree-position"&gt;1. Worktree 属于任务，不是另一个 Agent&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
